{% comment %}
  SNIPPET: snippets/tm-dp-notify.liquid
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Hidden Shopify contact form used by tm-digital-products.liquid
  to send store notification emails on Buy Now, Free Download,
  and Custom Order submissions.

  Lives in a snippet so it doesn't cause "schema must not be
  nested" errors — Liquid form tags can't be in section files
  that also contain a schema tag.

  JS in tm-digital-products.liquid calls tmDpFireNotification()
  which fills these hidden fields and submits via fetch.
  Shopify processes it and emails your store notification address
  exactly like the fan list contact form.
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
{% endcomment %}

<div style="display:none;position:absolute;pointer-events:none;" aria-hidden="true">
  {% form 'contact', id: 'tm-dp-notify-form' %}
    <input type="hidden" name="contact[name]"    value="">
    <input type="hidden" name="contact[email]"   value="">
    <input type="hidden" name="contact[body]"    value="">
    <input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="">
  {% endform %}
</div>
